Adapted by Halcyonic from Meta's Immersive Web SDK starter (@iwsdk/create 1.0.1, MIT, see LICENSE): the sample robot,
desk, plant, banner and sound were removed so the app fetches nothing at run time; the build configuration, types,
iwsdk.config.json, README.md and AGENTS.md are Halcyonic's own.
The pieces in src/pieces.ts by Bach and Satie are compositions in the public domain, their notes typed by hand from
public-domain editions of the score; an app made from this template may play them freely.
The skies in public/skies/ are made from two Poly Haven skies, each under CC0 1.0 (public domain;
https://polyhaven.com/license), by Greg Zaal with Jarod Guest: meadow.webp from "Kloofendal 48d Partly Cloudy (Pure
Sky)" (https://polyhaven.com/a/kloofendal_48d_partly_cloudy_puresky) and garden.webp from "Kloppenheim 06 (Pure Sky)"
(https://polyhaven.com/a/kloppenheim_06_puresky). Changed for this starter: each 2k HDR exposed, rolled off and cut to
its upper half as an sRGB WebP (91 KB for the two).
The models in public/models/nature/ are thirteen from Quaternius's Stylized Nature MegaKit, free Standard edition,
under CC0 1.0 (public domain; https://quaternius.com/packs/stylizednaturemegakit.html): CommonTree_1, CommonTree_2,
CommonTree_3, CommonTree_4, CommonTree_5, Bush_Common, Bush_Common_Flowers, Flower_3_Group, Flower_4_Group,
Rock_Medium_1, Rock_Medium_2, Rock_Medium_3 and Fern_1. Changed for this starter: joined into one glTF, its geometry
compressed with meshopt, its textures cut to 512 px WebP with their clear pixels filled with the leaf colour, and
Bush_Common given the common tree's green leaves (768 KB for the thirteen).
